{
 "elemod": 2,
 "id": "digifold",
 "version": "1.0",
 "title": "Digi Fold",
 "description": "A master wavefolder: a triangle fold with an on/off and an amount. Amount 0 is 1.0x (no fold); higher amounts fold the peaks harder and add harmonics. Runs after the ring and the EQ (ring -> EQ -> fold). Combines with every mod.",
